E_{\\rm FRB}=f_{b}E_{\\rm FRB,iso}=(10^{43}\\;{\\rm erg})f_{b,-1}\\dot{N}_{3}E_{\\rm iso,39}\\tau_{2},  where f_{b}\\equiv\\Delta\\Omega/4\\pi. This energy should be the minimum energy budget in the system.

